    <string name="section_about">Privacy &amp; about</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">All data stays on this device. The app has no internet permission, no accounts, no analytics and no ads. Exports are only created when you ask, and Android backup follows your system settings.</string>
    <string name="limitations_title">Known Android limitations</string>
    <string name="limitations_body">• Regular apps can\'t stop charging; protection works by alerting you.\n• Design capacity isn\'t exposed by Android.\n• Current sensors differ by manufacturer; the app learns units and direction and marks values until verified.\n• Background recording is limited by Doze; continuous monitoring improves precision.\n• Per-app energy use isn\'t available to regular apps.</string>

